+tools:
+  - source: bridgecrewio/checkov
+    version: CHECKOV_VERSION
+    reason: >-
+      Policy scanning for Kubernetes manifests, Dockerfiles, OpenTofu and
+      GitHub Actions workflows. It is the only tool here that has produced a
+      finding nothing else caught - CKV_GHA_7, on the expediter's dispatch
+      input. Its configuration is .checkov.yaml at the repository root, which
+      predates this and carries the reasoning for every exclusion in it.
