+      against HADOLINT_SHA256 - the same pattern as TruffleHog, because a
+      checksum beside the version is what makes a downloaded binary a pin
+      rather than a hope.
+  - source: zizmorcore/zizmor
+    version: ZIZMOR_VERSION
+    reason: >-
+      Static analysis for GitHub Actions workflows, which are the part of this
